    <detaileddescription>
<para>Parallel Protocol Engine</para>
<para>This module implements a parallel protocol engine that can handle multiple transactions in parallel.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This implementation assumes that the provided interfaces are compatible </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
